// Starter template — Product Requirements Document
// Copy this file, rename it, and fill it in. Every block below is a Jotstak primitive.

@cover Product Requirements — <Feature name>

@heading Overview
Problem, who it is for, and why now.
@note keep this to a paragraph you would say out loud

@decision title="The core bet"
  context: what is true today that makes this worth doing
  choice: the approach we are committing to
  consequences: what this makes easy, and what it makes hard

@heading Goals and non-goals
@table style=ruled
  In scope, Out of scope
  <goal>, <explicit non-goal>

@heading Success metrics
@metric name="Primary metric" target="<value>"

@heading Risks and assumptions
@risk level=high
  ...
@assumption
  ...
